Notchwatch is covered by three licences. Which one applies depends on where the
code came from:

  1. BSD 3-Clause  — the work of this fork.
  2. MIT           — code inherited from AgentNotch, the project this is a fork of.
  3. MPL-2.0       — Sources/Notchwatch/Window/CGSSpace.swift, vendored from Parrot.

The MIT text in section 2 also covers Sources/Notchwatch/Views/Notch/NotchShape.swift,
vendored from DynamicNotchKit under its own copyright — see section 4.

Sections 2, 3 and 4 apply in addition to section 1, never instead of it.


