  Sources/Notchwatch/Window/CGSSpace.swift

It is vendored from Parrot (https://github.com/avaidyam/Parrot, the file
MochaUI/CGSSpace.swift) and stays governed by the Mozilla Public License,
Version 2.0.

MPL-2.0 is file-level copyleft: the file may live inside a project under another
licence, but the file itself — and any modification to it — must stay available
under MPL-2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this file, you can
obtain one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.


